;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T07:02:11Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"logistics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"carrier-C\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"waybillNo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"C-9900123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"grossWeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"KGM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"packageCount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"consignee\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"idType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ID_CARD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"idHash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:3ab7...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"goods\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"itemNo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-4471\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"filingNo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FIL-2026-008812\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"commodityCode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3304990000\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">480.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>idHash</code> 而非证件号原名，是一个应当坚持的设计：申报确实需要证件信息，但<strong>企业侧的常规存储不必保留明文</strong>。原件留在受控的最小暴露面内，日常查询与比对用摘要。这与隐私设计的姿态一致——不是事后脱敏，而是从一开始就只让需要的路径接触明文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三单比对与本地前置闸门\">三单比对与本地前置闸门</h2><p>三单比对的业务含义是：核实这笔交易确实发生了（订单存在）、确实施付了（支付存在且金额相符）、货物确实在流动（运单存在且与订单对应）。政务侧会做这个比对，但<strong>企业侧做同样的比对能把绝大多数退单拦在发出去之前</strong>。</p>\n<p>比对的规则集是有序的，从强到弱：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>主体一致性：订单、支付、物流三段引用的是同一笔交易（通常通过订单号或交易号关联）。</li>\n<li>金额一致性：支付金额与订单成交金额相等，或在允许的容差内（优惠、运费分摊会导致不等）。</li>\n<li>收件人一致性：物流段的收件人与订单段的收货人为同一人。</li>\n<li>数量一致性：物流段的件数与订单段的商品件数相容（合并发货会让两者不等，需要按容差规则处理）。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 本地三单闸门：拦截可确定的不一致，不试图替代政务侧比对&#10;SELECT s.manifest_id, &#39;payment_amount_mismatch&#39; AS defect&#10;FROM manifest_segment s&#10;WHERE s.order_amount &lt;&gt; s.paid_amount&#10;  AND abs(s.order_amount - s.paid_amount) &gt; s.tolerance_amount&#10;UNION ALL&#10;SELECT s.manifest_id, &#39;consignee_mismatch&#39;&#10;FROM manifest_segment s&#10;WHERE s.consignee_order_hash IS DISTINCT FROM s.consignee_logistics_hash&#10;UNION ALL&#10;SELECT s.manifest_id, &#39;item_not_filed&#39;&#10;FROM manifest_goods g&#10;LEFT JOIN product_filing f&#10;  ON f.filing_no = g.filing_no AND f.channel_id = g.channel_id&#10;WHERE f.filing_no IS NULL OR f.status &lt;&gt; &#39;ACTIVE&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 本地三单闸门：拦截可确定的不一致，不试图替代政务侧比对</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">manifest_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'payment_amount_mismatch'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> defect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> manifest_segment s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tolerance_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">manifest_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'consignee_mismatch'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> manifest_segment s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">consignee_order_hash</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">consignee_logistics_hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">manifest_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'item_not_filed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> manifest_goods g</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_filing f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filing_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filing_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filing_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ACTIVE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第三条查询把商品备案状态纳入闸门，这是前面「商品备案是独立同步任务」的直接回报：如果备案同步可靠，这条查询就很少命中；一旦命中，说明主数据同步出了问题，应当在源头修而不是逐单兜底。</p>\n<h3 id=\"容差必须显式建模\">容差必须显式建模</h3><p>上面 SQL 里出现了 <code>tolerance_amount</code>。容差不是「代码里写着 0.01」，而是一个需要显式建模的业务事实，因为它的来源是多样的：平台优惠券导致支付额低于订单额、跨境运费由平台承担导致两者不等、汇率折算导致分位差。把容差规则集中在一处并对每笔申报留痕「本次适用了哪条容差规则」，是事后应对政务侧质疑的必要材料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>通道选择由<strong>监管方式代码</strong>决定，不由平台意愿决定；监管方式必须建模为带语义的枚举，因为它是字段集、税制与放行条件的根。</li>\n<li>综合税制无免征额但受个人额度约束，行邮税制有免征额但受限值管理——两条路线的业务规则在相邻 hub，本 hub 负责其与政务通道的对接面。</li>\n<li>前置登记（企业备案、场所备案、商品备案）有审批周期且会在<strong>业务层</strong>而非报文层驳回，必须纳入排期并建成可查询、有到期提醒的事实。</li>\n<li>商品备案是<strong>主数据同步任务</strong>，不是申报的一部分；混进申报链会让成功率受主数据质量拖累。</li>\n<li>清单组装必须<strong>保留每段数据的来源标识</strong>，否则三单比对失败时无法定位是哪一段不一致。</li>\n<li>本地三单闸门拦截可确定的不一致，但<strong>不替代政务侧裁决</strong>；容差规则要显式建模并留痕。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇：见 <a href=\"sw-manifest-payment-logistics\">清单/支付/物流数据一窗申报</a>，看这些数据段如何被组装成一份可复用的申报事实对象并送进窗口。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨境电商专用清关通道对接","id":"跨境电商专用清关通道对接"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：通道由监管方式决定，不由平台决定","id":"核心概念-通道由监管方式决定-不由平台决定"},{"level":2,"text":"通道对接的前置条件","id":"通道对接的前置条件"},{"level":3,"text":"企业备案与场所备案","id":"企业备案与场所备案"},{"level":3,"text":"商品备案与前置审批","id":"商品备案与前置审批"},{"level":3,"text":"场所与账册的绑定","id":"场所与账册的绑定"},{"level":3,"text":"个人额度与身份校验","id":"个人额度与身份校验"},{"level":2,"text":"清单申报的数据组装","id":"清单申报的数据组装"},{"level":2,"text":"三单比对与本地前置闸门","id":"三单比对与本地前置闸门"},{"level":3,"text":"容差必须显式建模","id":"容差必须显式建模"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"报文确认与状态归集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/single-window-digital-customs-connect/sw-integration-api/message-ack-status-normalize"},"next":{"title":"清单/支付/物流数据一窗申报","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/single-window-digital-customs-connect/digital-customs-channel/sw-manifest-payment-logistics"}}